      "id": "math-i-binomial-theorem-01",
      "prompt": "State the binomial theorem for \\((a+b)^n\\).",
      "answer": "For a non-negative integer \\(n\\),\n\\[\n(a+b)^n=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom{n}{k}a^{n-k}b^k\n\\]",
